WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.751
We're live in five,

00:00:01.751 --> 00:00:02.544
four,

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:03.336
three...

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:05.004
Let's begin, shall we?

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.678
In life

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:14.597
