to more questions.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:19.352
The only constant variable
is the unexpected.

00:00:19.894 --> 00:00:21.563
We can't control it,

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:22.897
It’s only when
you look backwards,

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:24.774
that you see how
it was all connected.

00:00:25.483 --> 00:00:26.609
Let’s begin, shall we. 

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:31.072
Mm, it's perfect.

00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:31.823
I like to cook.

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:33.283
It's just chemistry.

00:00:35.076 --> 00:00:37.537
You’re on the verge of a major
scientific breakthrough.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:39.456
This institution has a reputation

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:41.583
