00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:04.731
No. You are poised to
become a TV star.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:07.317
♫ Welcome to the final show. ♫

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:08.985
We are live in five, 

00:01:08.985 --> 00:01:09.778
four,

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:10.487
three-

