00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:28.213
What the F-

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:32.842
♫ Just stop your crying
have the time of your life ♫

00:01:32.842 --> 00:01:35.512
You’ve got something
almost no one has,

00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:37.639
♫ Breaking through the atmosphere ♫ 

00:01:37.639 --> 00:01:39.224
a platform.

00:01:39.682 --> 00:01:41.309
What you say matters.

00:01:41.309 --> 00:01:44.187
Politics don't
belong in the kitchen.

00:01:44.187 --> 00:01:48.274
A man wants his wife to make him
a drink after a long day at work. 

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:50.652
Why do you assume that his
day was longer than hers? 

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:52.487
